<title>USA: Styles on Video to sell newborn business.</title>
<headline>Styles on Video to sell newborn business.</headline>
<dateline>NEWBURY PARK, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Styles on Video Inc said it reached preliminary agreement with privately held HASCO International Inc for the sale to Hasco of its Forever Yours newborn photography business.</p>
<p>Under the term sheet reflecting the agreement in principle, HASCO would acquire Forever Yours' principal operating assets and assume certain liabilities. Other terms of the transaction are being negotiated and were not announced at this time.</p>
</text>
